<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for the Truth to Live By website preview. Newsletter collection is not enabled."><div class="wrap"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</span><h1>Privacy, considered.</h1><p class="lede">Clear information about what this website does with your data.</p></header><div class="prose-page"><aside class="sample-note"><strong>Preview notice — not a final launch notice.</strong> Newsletter signup is disabled. The owner must complete and approve this notice before any subscription collection begins.</aside><h2>This local preview</h2><p>This preview does not include an active newsletter form, website contact form, advertising tracker or analytics service. Fonts and illustrations are served with the site. It does not use a database or create a user account.</p><p>The site does not deliberately store cookies or local-storage identifiers. Ordinary hosting or local server request logs may record technical request information; the production hosting configuration and retention details have not yet been confirmed.</p><h2>Links to other services</h2><p>Links to YouTube and Instagram take you to those services. Their own privacy practices apply when you visit them. No YouTube player is loaded automatically on this website.</p><h2>Before newsletter signup opens</h2><p>The final notice must identify the site’s data controller and contact details, the selected newsletter service, the information collected, the relevant purposes and legal bases, retention arrangements, any international transfers and the safeguards that apply.</p><p>It must also explain withdrawal of consent and the applicable rights to access, correction, erasure, restriction, objection and portability, along with how to exercise them and how to complain to the appropriate supervisory authority.</p><h2>Contact correspondence</h2><p>A dedicated brand mailbox has not been configured in this preview. Before it is made available, this notice must explain how correspondence is handled, the email provider used, the purpose and legal basis, and how long messages are retained.</p><h2>Future changes</h2><p>Any introduction of analytics, embedded subscription forms or other processors requires a review of this notice and the actual data flows. A cookie-consent interface should be added only if the chosen implementation requires one.</p><p>For the brand’s current contact route, see <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>.</p></div></div></Base>
